 surprise, they each encounter overwhelming paranormal activities that transcend comprehension. Amid these predicaments, Momo awakens her hidden power and Okarun gains the power of a curse to overcome these new dangers! Their fateful love begins as well!?\n\nThe story of the occult battle and adolescence starts!\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)\n\nNotes:\n\n- Worldwide premiere of Episode 1 before the Japanese television premiere occurred at Anime Expo July 6, 2024.\n\n- Episodes 1-3 titled as DAN DA DAN: FIRST ENCOUNTER was pre-screened in advance in theaters on August 31, 2024 in Asia, September 7, 2024 in Europe and September 13, 2024 in North America. The regular TV broadcast began October 4, 2024."},"tags":[{"name":"Urban Fantasy","rank":97,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Youkai","rank":96,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ghost","rank":96,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Aliens","rank":94,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Super Power","rank":92,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Primarily Teen Cast","rank":89,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Surreal Comedy","rank":88,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shounen","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Henshin","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":77,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":77,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":77,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Exorcism","rank":74,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":71,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gyaru","rank":61,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Demons","rank":58,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":57,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Love Triangle","rank":56,"spoiler":true},{"name":"CGI","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Nudity","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tokusatsu","rank":36,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Unrequited Love","rank":35,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Shrine Maiden","rank":33,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Zombie","rank":32,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Achromatic","rank":27,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Acrobatics","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Blackmail","rank":20,"spoiler":true}],"tit